window.products.push({"id":382080,"name":"Cozy Herringbone | 100% Cotton Original Turkish Hand Towel (24.5x39) - Pre-Washed Peshtemal, Pool, Gym, Spa, Hammam, Kitchen, Bath Towel, Eco-Friendly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XcWOcmRmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for your next favorite towel? Tired of bulky towels that smell musty? Our towels touch every part of our body every day. We use it for drying up after a shower or a swim, and to wipe our sweat after hitting the gym or sauna. Because of this, it's important we use a towel that we can rely on to ensure that our skin doesn't get damaged from rough textures or moldy fabrics. If you want cloths that can give you both style and function, hammam towels are the way to go. These Turkish products are sought after due to their high absorbency rate and luxurious texture. Change the way you use towels with the Cozy Lush Turkish Towels! Choose a towel that pampers you every time it touches your skin. This peshtemal is woven using 100% ring cotton yarn. Rub it against your body as much as you want without causing any irritation. Plus, the fabrics we use are OEKO-TEX certified, which means each towel is made with materials that are free from elements or dyes that may damage your skin. Apart from this, you shouldn't have to worry about your cloths shrinking over time. We made sure our products are pre-washed and pre-ironed, so they stay the same size and shape as when you first received them. Wash and dry your towels as much as you want, and they'll come out more absorbent each time! Get your money's worth as you save more in the long run with our wraps. We made sure our Hammam towels are durable so you can use them for years. Our high-quality cloths are designed for everyday use–no shedding fibers or lint. Use them as your go-to towel for working out, backpacking, or camping. Still not impressed? Here are more reasons you'll love our towels: ✅ Oversized yet folds into a compact size ✅ Keeps away sand–perfect for beachgoers! ✅ Thoughtful and practical gift–who doesn't like luxe towels? Add the Cozy Lush Turkish Towels to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XcWOcmRmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cozy Lush","source_asin":"B08F4S1HVG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F4S1HVG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F4S1HVG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":382081,"name":"Coconut Bowls - Jumbo Size Natural Coconut Shell Bowls, Eco-Friendly & Handcrafted with Love, Tropical Design, Perfect for Acaii, Smoothies, Buddha Bo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61owvBxKRLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of Two Jumbo Size Coconut Bowls Our Vision Each year, billions of coconuts are ended up in wasted in landfills. The toxic emission of CO2 and Methane, that is caused by burning coconut shells, is a environmental and health hazard. By creating beautiful and sustainable products, we at Lovebowl strive for a world with less single-use plastic, cleaner ozone and a healthier and conscious lifestyle. Features ◆Beautiful design◆ Carved with precision, the pineapple and palm leaf pattern make those Smoothie Bowls look extra stunning on Instagram! ◆Size◆ Each bowl is unique, has it's own character and imperfections. But on average, one bowl has a diameter of 13-15cm (5-7 inches), 7cm (3inches) of height and 600-800ml (20-27oz) of volume. So they're bigger than normal coconut bowls. ◆Care◆ Although these bowls are lightweight and durable, they do need extra care. They will crack if exposed to extreme temperatures so it's not advised to put them in the oven, fridge, microwave, dishwasher or put extremely hot food inside. After each use, just wash them in soapy water. If they lose their shine, give them a rub with some extra virgin olive or coconut oil. Wether you're purchasing a set for yourself or gifting one to friends and family, you're taking the right step towards a healthier, conscious and sustainable lifestyle. Shop risk-free If you have any issues with your order, please message us and we'll provide you with a new set free of charge or give you a refund. We hope you love them as much as we do!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61owvBxKRLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lovebowl","source_asin":"B07D93G1NP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D93G1NP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D93G1NP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
