window.products.push({"id":382193,"name":"AILANDA 2PCS 16'' Artificial Boxwood Topiary Ball Outdoor Faux Boxwood Balls with LED Copper Wire Light for Balcony, Patio, Garden, Backyard, Wedding,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O60wGpk5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to install the topiary balls？ Method 1: 1. Connect the clip 2. Done; Method 2: 1. Tie the rope buckle to the gap 2. Cut off the excess part How to handle it if the balls are deformed? Just put it in the sun for a while or blow it with a hair dryer for a while to restore its shape. When opening the package, you will see the leaves were squeezed. It is recommended to unfurl so that the leaves can be restored shape easily. 【Topiary Balls with Lights】: Artificial topiary boxwood balls with light are made from high-quality plastic, durability and UV protection. Each leaf imitates real boxwood, look natural and lifelike, Long-lasting. Perfect for home decor at daytime, adding a splash of color to your garden at night. 【Package Contents】: It comes with 2PCS 16inch boxwood balls, 32.8ft LED Copper Wire Light (BATTERIES NOT INCLUDED) and 2PCS chain hocks. Each ball consists of two semi-circles, easy to install. each ball is equipped with a 3-prong metal hook chain for easy hanging decoration, suitable for large flower beds, porches, shopping malls, weddings, etc. 【2PCS 100 LED Lights】: (BATTERIES NOT INCLUDED) The lights are water-resistant with 8 light modes: 1.Combination 2.In waves 3.Sequential 4.Slogs 5.Chasing/flash 6.Slow fade 7.Twinkle/flash, 8.Steady on Different lighting effects could be controlled by the button on the plug. The faux garden spheres is suitable for home, wedding, living room, backyard, balcony, garden, Christmas green ball, winter spring greenery decor, housewarming gifts, etc. 【Perfect Artificial Balls】: The Faux boxwood balls look lifelike are made of high-end plastic that won't fade in the sun, making them suitable for indoor and outdoor decoration all year round. With full and dense bright green leaves, so pretty and vibrant, they will bring more vitality and green to your yard and front porch without any trimming or maintenance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O60wGpk5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AILANDA","source_asin":"B0BS5C3FNM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382193","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS5C3FNM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS5C3FNM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
