window.products.push({"id":382236,"name":"Lostcat Twin Size Daybed Bed with Trundle,Metal Bedframe with Safety Guardrails & Heavy Duty Steel Slat Support,for Kids Teens Adults,No Box Spring Ne","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81754vnOhfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: Made by sturdy metal, this daybed with trundle provides extra durability and safety. Additional metal slats support mattresses and extend their life effectively. The stylish design matches every decoration of your room. It is a great solution to extra sleeping place for guests. Selling points: Solid construction: Made by strong and sturdy metal provides durability and stability. The metal slats support the mattresses not to slide and allow air passing freely beneath your bed, keeping your mattress fresher longer to increase the mattresses life. Stylish design: The contemporary style provides a clean and stylish look helping complete and enhance the look of any living room or bedroom. Space saving: This multi-functional daybed with trundle is designed for rooms with limited floor space. It provides two additional sleep areas for overnight friends or family. It gives you flexibility to accommodate a variety of options. Fast assembly: Each order comes with a clear and detailed assembly instruction guide and all necessary tools are provided to get your bed assembled in no time. Also available in White, and Bronze metal frames. Dimensions: Weight & Dimensions Overall Product Dimension 77.48\"L x 41.1\"W x 43.3\"H Detail Product Dimension Daybed Dimensions: 77.48\"L x 41.1\"W x 19.29\"H Trundle Bed Dimensions: 70.86\"L x 38.97\"W Side Armrest to floor: 32.28\"H Distance Between Upper Bed and Floor: 12.99” The Slats Distance for Upper Bed:6.5” Number of Package 1 Package Dimension 78.74\"L x 15.35 \"W x 6.5 \"H Overall Product Weight 63.93 LBS Package Weight 72.75 LBS Weight Capacity Upper bed: 400 LBS Trundle bed :400 LBS Recommended Mattress Thickness and Size 6”-8” Daybed: standard twin Trundle: no handle at each end, can fit standard twin Specifications: Product Type Daybed with Trundle Size Twin Color Black/ White/ Brass Material STEEL Box Spring Required No Number of Slats Daybed: 11 Trundle bed :10 Assembly Required Yes Country of Origin Vietnam Notes: Manual measurement has been used, there may be some reasonable error. All the pictures are taken by actual samples, slight chromatic aberration may occur due to lighting or display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81754vnOhfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lostcat","source_asin":"B0BXT478F9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXT478F9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXT478F9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":382237,"name":"Airtight Better Dish with Lid for Countertop, Large Butter Dish with Cover, Porcelain Butter Keeper for East West Coast Butter and 8oz Butter, White -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ygXieCr2S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ADEQUATE CAPACITY AND DEPTH - The better butter dish measures 6.2\"x 4.2\"x 3\" ; Internal dimensions is 5.5\"x 3.5\"x 2\". It will fit all stick sizes including long or short from East and West Coast, and 8oz Kerrygold, Land O' Lakes, Plugra butter and more. And because of the depth, you will never get butter on the outside even after many uses. UPGRADE LID - The top lid has a silicone seal that will make the butter in the air-tight container so that the butter doesn't pick up any other refrigerator odors. And your butter is the perfect consistency for spreading easily on toast. GIFT IDEA - The covered butter dish matches your kitchen so well and looks cute sitting on the counter! This would make a great gift for Mother's Day or Father's Day if you have butter lovers in the house. NOT ONLY AS A BUTTER DISH BUT ALSO AS YOU WANT - The versatility of deep butter dish doesn't stop there. The wooden lid could be a cutting board; and you also can use the container as a little canister to store cream cheese, cookies that you want. WARM TIPS - The porcelain container is dishwasher, microwave and oven safe. But the wooden lid only HAND-WASH and wipe it with a cloth after washing. Avoid the lid soak in water for a long time, as it will cause the lid to expand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ygXieCr2S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Better Butter","source_asin":"B08NP4WFLQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NP4WFLQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NP4WFLQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
