window.products.push({"id":382319,"name":"OYEZI Vegetable Cleaver- Chinese Chefs Knife - Hand Forged Carbon Steel Chef's Knife Fulltang Handle with sheath Included knife sharpening rod","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7172xAOqmVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Using ancient Chinese forging technology, the blade is thick and strong, made of carbon steel, and can handle all needs except hard bones, such as pressing garlic ginger, cutting vegetables, cutting meat, thin slices, small pieces, etc. It is a key function that a Western-style chef's knife cannot achieve. The chef's knife has a traditional Chinese design with a perfectly curved blade. The handle is made of all-tang logs, which is very balanced when cutting, feels comfortable, and does not feel tired when cutting food. [100% hand-forged ] Our OYEZI carbon steel forged butcher knife is hand-forged by craftsmen with many years of experience. No machine welding is required, making the blade stronger and effectively preventing the blade from breaking. Moreover, the hand-forged pattern of each knife is randomly formed, and the impeccable performance creates the durability and comfort of the knife. [Very convenient to carry]-We have specially designed a unique leather knife cover for you to protect the blade, so that it is more beautiful and safer, and can be worn on the belt for outdoor use. After receiving the leather case, please hang it in a ventilated place for a few days. [How to maintain? 】Because it is forged from carbon steel, please clean the knives. Acid or alkaline substances should not be left on the blade for a long time, and the blade should not be in contact with corrosive materials. Running water is good for rinsing, and then wipe off water stains with a cloth. You can put some cooking oil on it, if it is not used for a long time, it should be stored in a dry place","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7172xAOqmVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OYEZI","source_asin":"B0BR49NG6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR49NG6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR49NG6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":382320,"name":"Can Coolers - 10 pack - Customizable Text, Logo - 4mm Collapsible Beer Holders To Keep Your Beer Cold - Insulated Cans Holder - Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vGX+JbOuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM - these customizable 4mm polyurethane foam can coolers are excellent for beer, soda, water, and more from and fit most 12-16 oz cans PERFECT FOR - weddings, giveaways and other brand awareness events alike. Use on BBQ's, at the beach, at your company events, and more. WASHABLE, REUSABLE, COLLAPSIBLE - these can coolers are extremely lightweight, collapsible, easy to carry, and look great on your can, water bottle, or other beverage. MAKE A SPLASH - these customizable can coolers have a nice sized imprint area and are perfect for that big event coming up such as a wedding, anniversary, grand opening, or birthday party. COLD DRINKS - these can coolers help with drink condensation (can sweat), helps keep drinks cold, and look great.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vGX+JbOuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DISCOUNT PROMOS","source_asin":"B08DZR77HS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DZR77HS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DZR77HS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":382321,"name":"Deer Stag Animal Wine Pourer Aerator, Also Available: Dog, Horse and Bear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OX3igpk4L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"WINE IS SPECIAL!! It used to be you, the bottle and a corkscrew. Now we treat wine with loving care. AERATING Wine begins the process of “softening tannins” and “rounding out texture,” and allowing a “smoother finish.” In the past, we opened the bottle and let it breathe for an hour or more – or – decant the bottle to “open it!” NOT ANY MORE -- our aerator “ages” the wine allowing the complex flavors and aromas to come out immediately. Our aerators allow you to fully enjoy your wine in a fun way! Choose from the deer, horse, dog or bear to liven up your wine experience! HAVE A PARTY with one or more pourers. They work great with your spirit bottles as well! ORDER ONE TODAY!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OX3igpk4L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"D & M","source_asin":"B00ZO1E9MK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZO1E9MK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZO1E9MK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
