window.products.push({"id":382356,"name":"Shine Decor 50FT LED Neon Rope Lights Outdoor Waterproof, AC 110V 120V Flexible NEON LED Strip Lights(Warm White), ETL Plug&Play 15M Neon Lights Strin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jlmDVaJCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PAY ATTENTION】 Check carefully to purchase the correct accessory pack for this LED neon rope light. Find ASIN B01N9OU93Z for the mounting aluminum channel track, ASIN B09WK3L5T1 for the power cord pack, ASIN B07QB17ZM9 for the mounting clip brackets pack. 【Weather Tolerance】UNROOL out the light rope fully before lighting up! This neon LED rope light can stand weather from -4℉ to 120℉. Premium LED with 120 high-quality SMD 2835 LEDs distributed, this neon rope light delivers high brightness and uniform soft glow without dark dots in 6W/M low power consumption. AC 110-120V plug and play, no need for extra voltage transformers. An ideal choice for your residential and commercial lighting decoration. 【Safe to Use】ETL-standard neon rope lights with safe and reliable fused power cord, no splash and UV, without mercury and no damage to human and environment. Sealed cap at the connecting areas and the end of rope light help avoid electric shock. Long lifespan of more than 50,000+ hrs. Each power cord connects max. 164ft neon rope lights, the neon rope light’s MINIMUM bending radius is 4cm. 【Connectable & Cuttable】The neon rope light is connectable, connect max length is 164ft. It has printed cutting marks(black dot) every 1.64ft/0.5m to guide you where to cut. Search B09WK3L5T1 for extra need of power cord for your DIY Project. Soft and flexible enough for creating different shapes and patterns to bring a stunning lighting effect. It’s time to action and make your distinguishing design! 【Reasonable Ambiance Lighting】 This neon rope light strip is flexible and bendable, made of durable and anti-yellowing PVC coating. IP65 Splash-proof, suitable for both indoor and outdoor lighting projects, like room, patio, landscape, garden, tree highlight lighting and signboard making. Fully waterproof all the connections when using it outdoors, also a great choice of lighting decor for your Christmas gift scene to warm your family and sweet kids. 【Quick Installation】The flexible LED neon rope light is easy to install, perfect for interior & exterior use to create bright cozy ambiance. Accessory already included for fixing and installing, if need straight linear lighting effect, check ASIN B01N9OU93Z for aluminum channel track to fix the light neon to your wanted surface.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jlmDVaJCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shine Decor","source_asin":"B0B616B827","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B616B827","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B616B827","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
