window.products.push({"id":382501,"name":"Resonating Designs Rose Gold Confetti Table Covers - Pack of 5 Plastic Rectangle Kitchen and Picnic Tablecloths - Party Decorations for Birthday, Grad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wDNf7wplL._AC_SL1490_.jpg","description":"Wish your tables had more WOW-factor? This new Rose Gold color was made to match and complement the Rose Gold Dinnerware. Tables aren't just for function at events--they also contribute a lot to an event's overall theme and ambiance. Chic and elegant tables instantly enhance the classy vibe of a party, while dull furniture does the opposite. Bare tables can even show a lack of foresight. Fortunately you don't need to buy all new tables just to impress at parties. A nice tablecloth will do. But many disposable tablecloths--although pretty--are built thin and flimsy. For big events, you're going to need something that can wick away even dark, dreaded wine stains. Turn any dining surface into a high-class party table with Resonating Design’s Rose Gold Dot Confetti Table Covers! Our rectangular 54” x 108” table covers is a must have for baby showers, wedding receptions, engagement parties, family dinners, and social gatherings. The tablecloth is made from heavy-duty plastic and will protect your tables from the moment the party starts until the last guest leaves. Now’s your chance to beautify your dining area without buying expensive decorations and ornaments. The cover’s confetti design gleams with sophistication and elegance. This waterproof tablecloth protects tables instantly, making party prep easier and less of a hassle. Still not convinced? Here are more reasons to help you make a decision: ✅ Made of sturdy non-toxic plastic ✅ Disposable: makes clean ups a breeze ✅ Features a design that blends with any theme ✅ Can also be used to shield floors during DIY crafts projects Dress your tables to impress. Add Resonating Design’s Rose Gold Dot Confetti Table Covers to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wDNf7wplL._AC_SL1490_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Resonating Designs","source_asin":"B07TXXL7M2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TXXL7M2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TXXL7M2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
