window.products.push({"id":382592,"name":"Vimqual Floating Shelf for AV Device/Projector/Cable Boxes/WiFi Router, Wall Mounted Display Ledges for Storage Plants, Wood Wall Shelves for Bedroom,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61snRNFXBeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Wide Floating Shelves】The size of the wall shelf board are 15.7” L x 7.87“ W x 0.59\" H. The widened shelf can provide more storage space, it can be used as Electronics Mounts for installation and storage of TV components such as DVD players, Blu-ray players, routers, TV boxes, cable boxes, projectors, game consoles, smart speaker, etc. 【Modern Wall Shelf】Our floating shelf is made of MDF. Black matt finish and black metal frame, creating a simple and modern style. Not only can it increase the storage space of the wall, but also has a certain decorative effect. Applicable to a variety of scenarios. 【Multifunctional Shelves】Wall shelves can not only be used to store and display streaming media equipment, green plants, books, DVDs, trophies, collectibles, photos, decorations, etc. in the living room/ bedroom/ video room/ game room/ office/ meeting room etc. It can also be used in the bathroom to store toiletries such as shampoo, shower gel, or in the kitchen to store spice and seasoning bottles. 【Two Installation Methods】 We provide two installation methods: paste installation and drilling installation. For walls with smooth surfaces such as tiles, marble, wood boards, and glass that are not easy to fall off, they can be installed without drilling. For drywall, wallpaper, paint, cement and other walls, you can choose to punch and install.The hanging wall shelf can bear 20lbs after correct installation. 【Fully Accessories】Package includes MDF board *1, metal brackets *2, wall anchors *4, drywall anchors *4, screws *4, connection buckle *4, nail free sticker*4 and installation manual *1. If you have any questions, please get in touch with our support team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61snRNFXBeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vimqual","source_asin":"B0B81RX7XJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382592","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B81RX7XJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B81RX7XJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
