window.products.push({"id":382718,"name":"Smocu 2L Portable Complete Quiet Cool Mist Humidifers for Bedroom/Home/Office/Plant,Cute Humidifiers for Baby Room,Top Fill,Easy Cleaning,Zero Leakage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gRkh0R+rL._AC_SL1053_.jpg","description":"【Best Small Humidifiers for Bedroom, Excellent Small Humidifiers for Baby Room】: You/Your Baby will Sleep Soundly with this Cool Mist Humidifiers for Bedroom,Which Provides the Healthiest Humidity with Completely Quiet and Favorite Night Light. 【Perfect Small Humidifiers for Home/Office/Plant】: This Personal Humidifier is Good Evaporative Humidifiers for Home/Plant,as It's Battery Powered and Portable Humidifier. You can also Enjoy Quiet Humidity from this Vaporizer Humidifier While at the Office. 【Top Fill Design and Easy to Clean】: Just 2 Steps-Take off the Lid and Pour Water Directly From the Faucet or Kettle into the Removable Tank.Moreover,Say Goodbye to Leakage of Water. Besides, the Oval Shape Makes Cleaning the Removable Tank Easily. 【Visible Water Level】: With Water Level Window, The Water Volume is Easy to Watch, So You Can Add Water in Time.In Case That NO Water is Left In the Tank ,It will Automatically Cut Off the Electricity to avoid Short Circuit, So Just Rest Assured. 【Colorful&Closable Night Light 】: Sleep without Light, Or Turn On Light and Set it to Your Favorite Color Out of 7 Beautiful Colors. 【Whole Night Duration】: Last up to 9 Hours at One-Sided Mist Output Mode(Recommended),or 4.5 Hours at Both-Sided Mist Output Mode While Fully Charged and Using Battery Only.Or Automattically Shut Down by 50h at One-Sided Mode and 25h at Both-Sided Mist Output Mode While using Electricity Directly from the Socket or Power Bank,etc. 【Completely Quiet】 : This Cool Mist Humidifiers for Bedroom and Ultrasonic Cool Air Humidifiers for Home and Office is ideal for Sleeping and Working ,As It Will Not Make Any Sound of Water Gurgle Nor other Noise. 【Portable Design】：This Ultrasonic Humidifier is Battery Powered,So You could Move it Around to Anywhere You Need,from Living Room to Bedroom, from Home to Office,or from Indoors to Outdoors. 【Note】: Please Note that it will NOT Vaporize All of the Water When Automatically Shut Off.Instead,It'll Dynamically Vaporize 20ml to 50ml of Water per Hour per Spray Nozzle to Keep the Appropriate Humidity.So it's More Suitable and Excellent for Small Rooms.Otherwise,please Keep it Near to Humidify.Besides,please Clean The Humidifier On A Regular Basis To Avoid Possible Mold Or Limescale.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gRkh0R+rL._AC_SL1053_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"smocu","source_asin":"B0BKSNBQ4F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382718","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKSNBQ4F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKSNBQ4F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
