window.products.push({"id":382734,"name":"Sultan's Linens Eco-Friendly Peva Table Pad Waterproof Surface with Flannel Backing Floral (120-inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9128Gw8qxnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sultan's Linens table pad features a floral embossed 100% PEVA surface. PEVA is eco friendly and not harmful to the environment. The PEVA surface is waterproof and will stop any leaks or spills ensuring the best protection of your delicate table or furniture. The pad also features a soft polyester flannel backing to prevent any scratching to your table or furniture. The flannel backing also prevents skidding and keeps your tablecloth secure and in place. The Sultan's Linens Table Pad has many other uses; it can be used as a shelf liner or anything else you may need. It comes in many sizes, but may be trimmed or cut to any size necessary.It measures 120 inches long by 52 inches wide, please use the size guide to pick a suitable size for your table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9128Gw8qxnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sultan's Linens","source_asin":"B07GSJB5Z7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382734","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GSJB5Z7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GSJB5Z7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":382735,"name":"Sculpted Magnet: Friends for Life, 3.0\" x 3.5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pD6837TFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With their vibrant, contemporary colors and thoughtful words from some of America's most loved authors, Blue Mountain Arts Sculpted Magnets are a perfect way to let the special people in your life know just how much they are loved and appreciated. Each carefully crafted magnet is fashioned of sturdy, durable resin and features a variety of embellishments, 3-dimensional carvings or cut-outs that make each one truly unique; for added visual interest, the background colors of each magnet are gently swirled to create a lovely marble-like appearance. And, with themes that include family, friendship, relationships, encouragement, love and more, they're the perfect addition to any card or gift or just as a spur-of-the-moment purchase to brighten someone's day! Since 1971, Blue Mountain Arts has been helping people communicate their deepest, most sincere thoughts and feelings about love, friendship, family, ideals and dreams. The Colorado-based company founded by poet Susan Polis Schutz and physicist/illustrator Stephen Schutz is known world-wide for its innovative art styles, quality paper and ever-increasing selection of authors, artists, and product lines. The same quality and high standards established with the very first Blue Mountain Arts products continue today to make them standouts in the marketplace, filling a very unique and necessary need ... that of helping people communicate their feelings and connect with the special people in their lives.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pD6837TFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Mountain Arts","source_asin":"B00G6S3L88","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G6S3L88","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G6S3L88","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
