window.products.push({"id":382814,"name":"Rachael Ray Create Delicious Deep Nonstick Frying Pan / Fry Pan / Skillet with Lid - 9.5 Inch, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UrfiRhchL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Radiant and solution-oriented, the Rachael Ray Create Delicious 9.5-Inch Aluminum Nonstick Deep Frying Pan brings high-performance and easy convenience to an essential pan made even more versatile with a deeper design. Featuring vibrant, shimmering color combined with value-driven functionality, this indespensible fry pan brings on Rachael's always-reliable performance with durable aluminum construction for ultra-even heating and browning. Made with higher sides for an enhanced cooking surface, this smart skillet features PlatinumShield(tm) Technology silver nonstick reinforced to be 9X harder than titanium for effortless food release of the stickiest recipes like Rach's Spinach-Artichoke Cheesy Tortellini or her Sticky Orange Chicken with Herbs.Even better, the frying pan is dishwasher safe for quick and easy cleanup. A colorful, double-riveted stainless steel and silicone handle provides comfort and control that's oven safe to 400°F, flared rims make for easy pouring, and an induction-suitable stainless steel base provides strength, durability, and versatility to use the frying pan on any stovetop.From dishwasher-safe convenience to the enhanced durability of PlatinumShield(tm) nonstick, reach for the easy brilliance of the Rachael Ray Create Delicious 9.5-Inch Aluminum Nonstick Deep Frying Pan and get ready to get delish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UrfiRhchL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rachael Ray","source_asin":"B07ZLPH34D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382814","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZLPH34D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZLPH34D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":382815,"name":"Landscape at Beaulieu by Pierre Renoir, 18x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715dyiJGf5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a landscape of trees. Pierre Renoir was a French painter originally associated with the Impressionist movement. He was one of the central figures of the impressionist movement. His work is characterized by a richness of feeling and warmth of response to the world and to the people in it. Renoir was so passionate about painting that he even continued when he was old and suffering from severe arthritis. Renoir then painted with a brush tied to his wrists. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715dyiJGf5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00GSOQT0W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382815","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GSOQT0W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GSOQT0W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
