window.products.push({"id":382871,"name":"HOMICHEF 12 oz Small Coffee Canister Airtight With Scoop And 1-Way CO2 Valve For Ground Coffee - Small Stainless Steel Coffee Canisters With Airtight ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lWBVYWXjL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"FRESH, FLAVORFUL, FAVORITE COFFEE BEGINS HERE 1. This elegant stainless steel coffee canister features an airtight seal and a one-way air valve built into the lid which allows CO2 to escape, but won't allow air to enter as the sealer is closed onto the inlet when air comes from outside.2. Make coffee storage a breeze and keep the freshness of your coffee grounds or beans.3. Every morning or at any time, reach for your favorite coffee stored in the chic canister. STYLISH STAINLESS STEEL & FULLY AIR-TIGHT DESIGN 1. Made of food grade stainless steel with matte polished design, this coffee canister has a classic stylish effect, adding function & modern design to any coffee place.2. With excellent corrosion resistance, this stainless steel canister is durable and always looks like new.3. A silicone ring between the lid and valve is used to reinforce the sealed device to prevent air from the canister, so that coffee beans or grounds won't get oxidized. DATE TRACK FRESHNESS FOR A DREAM BREW 1. The canister lid is also a date tracker. The inner wheel (numbers 1-12) is for months and the outer wheel (numbers 1-31) is for days, allowing for marking the storage date or the expiration date to track optimal coffee freshness.2. Enjoy fresh coffee every day with elegent & durable & effective stainless steel coffee canister! FAQ 1. Before cleaning, dismount the valve from the lid by pushing it outward and keep the valve DRY. NEVER wash the valve.2. For coffee freshness, it is recommended to store the ground coffee for maximum periods of 6-9 months. ATTENTION 1. It is NOT recommended to store the coffee canister into a refrigerator or freezer.2. Set the months by lining up the number with the arrow on the lid. Please use TWO fingers to push down and turn at the same time. Enjoy COFEE Enjoy LIFE :)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lWBVYWXjL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMICHEF","source_asin":"B07R9YBZ8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-382871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R9YBZ8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R9YBZ8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
